  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- CAN bus: frame model and transport abstraction (`ICanTransport`) with in-memory/loopback transport\n      - CAN bus: Intel/Motorola bit-layout signal encode/decode to `Signal` and `Measurement`\n      - CAN bus: DBC file parser and signal decoder with multiplexing, scaling, and range-based quality\n      - CAN bus: SocketCAN, PCAN, and Kvaser platform transport stubs\n      - ARINC 429: 32-bit word encode/decode with BNR scaling and parity handling",
